# Collected data. The raw export (400 MB) and the ratings matrix (146 MB) stay
# out of git; the two artifacts the deployed app actually reads are committed,
# because Streamlit Community Cloud builds straight from the repo and has no
# other way to get them. Together they are ~17 MB.
data/*
!data/processed/
data/processed/*
!data/processed/games.parquet
!data/processed/item_item.npz

raw_cache/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# Keep test fixtures
!tests/fixtures/

